:name: NXP i.MX 952 EVK firmware-level MU7 A55 + M7 demo
:description: Runs real A55 and Cortex-M7 instructions that exchange a request and response through the dual-endpoint MU7 model

using sysbus

include $ORIGIN/nxp_imx952_evk.resc

$a55Firmware?=$ORIGIN/../../tests/platforms/NXP_IMX952/a55_mu7_firmware.hex
$m7Firmware?=$ORIGIN/../../tests/platforms/NXP_IMX952/m7_mu7_firmware.hex

macro reset
"""
    emulation Reset

    sysbus LoadHEX $a55Firmware
    sysbus LoadHEX $m7Firmware

    a55Cluster.a55_0 PC 0x80000000
    a55Cluster.a55_0 IsHalted false
    m7 SP 0x20040000
    m7 PC 0x00000008
    m7 IsHalted false
"""

runMacro $reset

# Start execution with: start
# After the exchange, inspect:
#   sysbus ReadDoubleWord 0x88020030  -> 0x600D7007 (A55 accepted M7 reply)
#   sysbus ReadDoubleWord 0x88020034  -> 0x4D3755AA (M7 accepted A55 request)
